{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <parallel id=\"p\">\n    <state id=\"r1\" initial=\"r1a\"><state id=\"r1a\"/><state id=\"r1b\"/></state>\n    <state id=\"r2\" initial=\"r2a\"><state id=\"r2a\"/><state id=\"r2b\"/></state>\n    <transition event=\"both\" target=\"r1b,r2b\"/>\n  </parallel>\n  <state id=\"a\"><transition event=\"start\" target=\"p\"/></state>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml005-comma-separated-targets.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml005-comma-separated-targets.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":7,"byteOffset":306,"endColumn":45,"endLine":5,"startColumn":38,"startLine":5},"insertedContent":{"text":"r1b r2b"}}]}],"description":{"text":"separate the targets with spaces"},"properties":{"applicability":"machine-applicable"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml005-comma-separated-targets.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":45,"endLine":5,"startColumn":38,"startLine":5}}}],"message":{"markdown":"transition targets are whitespace-separated, not comma-separated: `r1b,r2b` is not one state ID\n\n**Note:** `target` is a space-separated list of state IDs; a comma makes the list one ID that no state declares\n\n**Help:** separate the target IDs with spaces: `r1b r2b`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.5 <transition>","text":"transition targets are whitespace-separated, not comma-separated: `r1b,r2b` is not one state ID"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":313,"start":306},"category":"semantic"},"ruleId":"SCXML005"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"a transition's `target` must be one or more IDs of states in the same SCXML document; an unresolved target makes the document non-conformant"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: correct the identifier or declare the missing state.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.5 <transition>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML005` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#transition","id":"SCXML005","name":"SCXML005","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"a transition target does not name a state in this document"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}